A statement whose conversion hits an unresolved name ("Unknown variable") was
dropped without any property: here the whole loop, and the failing assertion
inside it, vanished and the result was VERIFICATION SUCCESSFUL. Every such
statement now carries a definite-failure python-not-encoded property.
